  // the agreement is fully signed, signalling GoStork's portion of the
  // workflow is complete and the provider has taken over.
  handoffCompletedAt   DateTime?
  // Most recent image the parent uploaded in this chat. The look-alike face
  // matcher (find_lookalike_matches) searches against this photo; the AI
  // router injects it into the tool args (never trusts a model-supplied URL).
